  unitName: Peacekeeper Sesir (EU)
  unitId: 720227
  unitNumber: 7198
  description: Sesir had always been against violence. She had followed Plumatachi
    and Blink in their fight because she wanted to end the oppression of Coal Cauldron
    and Pig Bull. Many people noticed that she had feelings for Jake. They hoped
    that she wouldn't follow Plumatachi's destructive path, and would stop fighting
    once and for all to live a quiet life with Jake.
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: I am done with war and hate. I will use this power for peace.
  evoDesc: I now fight only to protect.
